+/*
+ * marble: identify a class by name in the loaded policy.
+ *
+ * SECCLASS_* constants index classmap.h, which lists process2 third. A
+ * policy that binds process2 last shifts everything after it; this
+ * device reports process2 = 93, so classmap.h's file (7) addresses "dir"
+ * at runtime and the policy's "file" is 6. Never key a mask on the
+ * compile-time constant — resolve the name through the policy instead.
